    <!-- Introduction -->
    <section class="py-20 bg-white">
        <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center">
            <span class="text-brand font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-sm">About the Workshop</span>
            <h2 class="font-serif text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-gray-900 mt-2 mb-8">
                From Confusion to Clarity
            </h2>
            <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto text-lg text-gray-600 leading-relaxed">
                <p class="mb-6">
                    Family life can be chaotic. Between busy schedules and misunderstandings, we sometimes forget how to truly connect. This educational workshop is designed not just to teach theory, but to practice real tools you can use at your kitchen table tonight.
                </p>
                <p>
                    You will learn how to structure family meetings, express feelings without blame, and listen with true empathy.
                </p>
            </div>
            
