                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye mr-2"></i>Objectives</h4>
                                <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                                    <li>Explain the purpose of short family meetings and when they are useful.</li>
