                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece mr-2"></i>Activities</h4>
                                <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                                    <li>Story contrasting chaos vs. calm in communication.</li>
                                    <li>Diagram explaining the structure of a 10-minute meeting.</li>
                                    <li>Group discussion: What happens when there is no structure to solve problems?</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Session 2 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row transform transition hover:shadow-xl">
                    <div class="bg-brand-dark p-8 md:w-1/4 flex flex-col justify-center items-center text-white text-center">
                        <span class="text-5xl font-bold">2</span>
                        <span class="text-xl mt-2 font-serif">“I-Messages” to Share Feelings</span>
                        <span class="mt-4 bg-gray-800 px-3 py-1 rounded text-sm">Tue, Oct 21</span>
                    </div>
                    <div class="p-8 md:w-3/4">
                        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mb-4 border-b pb-2">Expressing Feelings Effectively</h3>
                        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6">
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bullseye mr-2"></i>Objectives</h4>
                                <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                                    <li>Explain what an "I-Message" is and how it improves communication.</li>
                                    <li>Differentiate between "I-Messages" and "You-Messages" and their effects on relationships.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                            <div>
                                <h4 class="font-bold text-brand mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-puzzle-piece mr-2"></i>Activities</h4>
                                <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 space-y-2">
                                    <li>Humorous story about a daily misunderstanding.</li>
                                    <li>Mini-lesson on the structure of the "I-Message".</li>
                                    <li>Discussion on why "You-Messages" (accusations) generate conflict.</li>
                                    <li>Practical demo: Converting a "You-Message" into an "I-Message".</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <!-- Session 3 -->
                <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-lg overflow-hidden flex flex-col md:flex-row transform transition hover:shadow-xl">
