                                    <li>Screening of the video "It’s Not About the Nail" and discussion.</li>
                                    <li>Role-play demonstrating "Fix-It Mode" vs. "Active Listening Mode".</li>
                                    <li>Pair practice reinforcing empathy, eye contact, and paraphrasing.</li>
                                </ul>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
